argon-utils (0.1.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * argond serves org.argonutils.Daemon1 on the system bus. Whoever may
    power off from the desktop may also ask argond, through polkit, to
    power off with a scheduled wake -- no sudo needed.
  * The tray offers "Power off now… and wake in 1 hour / in 8 hours /
    tomorrow at 07:00", when polkit would allow it.

